<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25808" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασημ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mark out, point out clearly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.1.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					12.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>indicate by a signal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάλπιγγι τὸν καιρὸν τῆς προσβολῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.12.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>note the bearings of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					549b17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>approve,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>signify,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>show its symptoms, appear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				6.41
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
